animation_notes: |
  ## Cinematic Simulation Prompt — 05: 9-Stage Audit Pipeline

  **SCENE 1 — "The Awakening" (0:00–0:06)**
  Camera: Static center-frame. Environment: Absolute dark-blue vacuum (#0a0e27).
  A high-resolution CORTEX logo (cortex-docs/assets/images/cortex-logo-512.png) fades in,
  centered on a ray-traced glassmorphism floor. An 'electric-aura' animation ignites —
  concentric cyan (#00d4ff) and purple (#7b61ff) pulse-glows radiate outward, reflecting
  off the polished glass surface. Volumetric blue fog at floor level. Hold 4s.
  Logo shrinks to bottom-right watermark (15% opacity).

  **SCENE 2 — "FPV Drone Dive: The Vertical Pipeline" (0:06–0:14)**
  Camera: FPV drone dives from the logo downward through volumetric fog. A vertical
  glass pipeline materializes — eleven frosted glassmorphism stage chambers stacked
  top-to-bottom, connected by luminous glass conduits. Each chamber is Deep Cobalt
  (#1a1f3a) with Midnight Blue (#0a0e27) edges and internal neon filaments.
  The pipeline appears to float in the vacuum, ray-traced reflections rippling down
  the glass tower. Background blur: 20px refraction on all surfaces.

  **SCENE 3 — "The Audit Particle Descends" (0:14–0:32)**
  A bioluminescent cyan orb (audit particle) spawns at "/audit fix" — the entry point
  at the top. It enters each stage chamber sequentially:
  - Stage -1 (Environment Readiness): chamber glows green, pass badge materializes.
  - Stage 0 (Inflight Upgrade): chamber pulses amber, git-fetch animation inside.
  - Stage 1 (Governance Pre-Flight): "Lidar Blue" laser sweep scans chamber interior.
  - Stage 2 (19-Point Production Scan) — THE HERO MOMENT: chamber expands to 3×
    its normal size. A scanning grid of 19 laser beams fans out inside the frosted
    glass. A violations table materializes as a floating glassmorphism HUD — rows
    populate one by one (red for P0, amber for P1, blue for P2). The chamber pulses
    red (#ff4444) — highest drama. Camera pauses here for 4 seconds.
  - Stages 3–6: particle progresses — Wiring Validation (purple filaments),
    Health Checks (green filaments, 22 orchestrator heartbeats visible),
    Vacuum Cleanup (glass debris dissolves), Meta-Audit (purple scan).

  **SCENE 4 — "The Convergence Loop" (0:32–0:46)**
  Camera: Tracks the particle entering Stages 7-8 — a CIRCULAR GLASS TRACK that
  branches off the main pipeline. The circular track is frosted glassmorphism with
  amber (#ffa500) neon filaments. The particle enters the loop:
  - Iteration 1: Detect → Fix → Rescan. Violation counter HUD shows "12 → 5" (amber glow).
    The particle orbits once — bioluminescent trail accumulates.
  - Iteration 2: Fix → Rescan. Counter shows "5 → 1" (amber glow, dimmer).
    The trail brightens with a second orbital layer.
  - Iteration 3: Fix → Rescan. Counter shows "1 → 0" — GREEN EXPLOSION: the entire
    circular track erupts in green (#00ff88) radiance. Volumetric green fog bursts
    outward. Glassmorphism badge materializes: "p0 == 0 AND p1 == 0" in cyan text.
  The particle exits the loop back into the main pipeline.

  **SCENE 5 — "Test Gate & Completion" (0:46–0:52)**
  Stage 9: the final chamber glows green (#00ff88). Full test suite fires — represented
  as hundreds of tiny bioluminescent orbs racing through the chamber (parallel test
  execution). AC_COMPLETE marker materializes as a glowing cyan timestamp badge.
  The entire vertical pipeline illuminates simultaneously — all stages green — a
  cascade of light from top to bottom. The SQLite audit trail database renders as a
  glass cylinder to the right, receiving log entries via purple neon conduits.

  **SCENE 6 — "Orbital Reveal" (0:52–1:00)**
  Camera: 360-degree orbital pan around the complete vertical pipeline + convergence
  loop. All stages glow at full luminosity. The bioluminescent audit trail persists
  as a permanent neon path. Volumetric fog swirls at the base. Ray-traced reflections
  cascade across every glass surface. Camera completes orbit, pulls back.
  Architecture fades to 40%. Glassmorphism "Evidence Bundle" icon materializes
  center-frame — sealed document with cyan checkmark — fades to black.
